# `config:key:timeout`. `/slow` is `arrival-server.mjs`'s one deliberately delayed path (50 ms, added
# for `C49`) — far above any scheduling jitter and far below any sensible budget, so a tight
# `timeout step` fails against it on every machine and a loose one passes on every machine.

test "one step against the deliberately slow path"
  api GET /slow
  expect status equals 200
